# docs/ is otherwise included (the reference files are small), but PII workbooks
# must never be baked into an image that gets pushed to a registry. The
# coordinator roster is mounted at runtime from the gitignored ./private/.
private/
docs/reference/*.xlsx
# EXCEPTION: the forecasting workbook is the parity-test spec and holds no
# personal data — keep it available inside the image.
!docs/reference/USA INV CHK.xlsx
*.sqlite3
.DS_Store
